{
  "title": "Quietly Wholesome Canadian Lentil Stew",
  "description": "A winey and juicy Canadian dish featuring brown lentils, perfect for a kid-friendly meal, this stew is made with a shio-koji cure and is onion and garlic free.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
